bottom: 3px solid #222;\n        padding-bottom: 6px;\n    }\n    .main-content {\n        padding: 45px 35px 60px 35px;\n    }\n    .quote-block-1 {\n        text-align: center;\n        margin-bottom: 35px;\n    }\n    .quote-line-underlined {\n        display: inline-block;\n        font-family: 'SimSun', 'Songti SC', serif;\n        font-size: 40px;\n        color: #222;\n        border-bottom: 1px solid #222;\n        padding-bottom: 2px;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n        letter-spacing: 2px;\n    }\n    .label {\n        font-size: 17px;\n        color: #222;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .text-body {\n        font-size: 16px;\n        color: #333;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n        text-align: justify;\n        margin-bottom: 45px;\n    }\n    .quote-block-2 {\n        text-align: center;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n    .quote-line-plain {\n        font-family: 'SimSun', 'Songti SC', serif;\n        font-size: 30px;\n        color: #222;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"page-container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <div class=\"header-left\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder logo\">[Logo: 人民日报 (Red Calligraphy)]</div>\n                <div class=\"pinyin\">RENMIN RIBAO</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"header-right\">\n                <div class=\"header-tagline\">金句 | 摘抄</div>\n                <div class=\"header-title\">心态主题</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"main-content\">\n            <div class=\"quote-block-1\">\n                <span class=\"quote-line-underlined\">且行且忘且随风，</span><br>\n                <span class=\"quote-line-underlined\">且行且看且从容。</span>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"label\">释义：</div>\n            <div class=\"text-body\">\n                意思是顺风而行，轻松的走着;边走边观察，不慌不忙，从容不迫。引申意思就是当我们]遇到非常不平静的时候，只要能有一个平静的心态，才能找出平静的办法去解决，讲的是从容面对的淡定心态。人生百味，浓缩到最后，就是一个淡字，正确地选择与取舍，是一生必修的功课。\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"quote-block-2\">\n                <div class=\"quote-line-plain\">\n                    我将玫瑰藏于身后风起花落，<br>\n                    从此鲜花赠自己，<br>\n                    纵马踏花向自由。\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"label\">释义：</div>\n            <div class=\"text-body\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\">\n                我把心中的的美好向往藏在身后，当面对现实的时候美好的向往会随着花儿掉落，而从此以后美好赠送给自己，骑着马儿迎着美好向往自由。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
